      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on these training docs for our new customer service team. i have this transcript from a call yesterday but it's a bit of a mess and hard to follow. can you rewrite this into professional business english for the manual? also let me know if u think this kind of speech is good for the official training guides or if it's too much of a distraction.\n\nTranscript:\n\"Yo, listen, I been tryin to get my refund for like a week now and nobody doin nuthin. I called twice and they kept trippin. I need my money back like yesterday, for real. Is y'all even checkin the tickets or what?\"",
